1
00:02:27,560 --> 00:02:28,479
Wanmei.

2
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:32,960
I suddenly heard at the office

3
00:02:33,919 --> 00:02:35,319
that you're marrying my brother.

4
00:02:39,280 --> 00:02:40,520
Am I not good enough,

5
00:02:41,759 --> 00:02:42,960
or do you have your reasons?

6
00:02:43,280 --> 00:02:44,120
Tell me.

7
00:02:44,560 --> 00:02:45,719
I can fix it.

8
00:02:48,199 --> 00:02:48,919
Cheng An.

9
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:51,840
I'm really going to marry your brother.

10
00:02:52,560 --> 00:02:54,680
He is the kind of man I want.

11
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:57,479
Only he can give me everything I want.

12
00:02:59,400 --> 00:03:00,599
And you aren't.

13
00:03:00,759 --> 00:03:03,360
You'll only ever be a tagalong following behind your brother.

14
00:03:09,280 --> 00:03:10,599
It's not that I'm incapable.

15
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:13,120
My brother is the only one in this family who treats me well.

16
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:16,120
I just don't want to fight him.

17
00:03:17,319 --> 00:03:18,639
I didn't know you felt that way.

18
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:21,120
"Don't want to fight."

19
00:03:23,039 --> 00:03:25,280
Only the strong survive in this world.

20
00:03:25,680 --> 00:03:27,800
Only the strong earn respect.

21
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:30,240
What do I get from being with you?

22
00:03:31,960 --> 00:03:34,280
I don't want to live in someone's shadow forever.

23
00:03:35,560 --> 00:03:36,400
Wanmei.

24
00:03:42,120 --> 00:03:43,080
Cheng An.

25
00:03:45,039 --> 00:03:46,400
You and I are both weak.

26
00:03:48,639 --> 00:03:49,840
The weak

27
00:03:51,039 --> 00:03:52,199
have no right to speak of love.

28
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:05,599
Sang Luo!

29
00:04:11,159 --> 00:04:12,039
Director Cheng.

30
00:04:12,319 --> 00:04:13,599
I'm really sorry.

31
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:15,719
I accidentally

32
00:04:15,719 --> 00:04:17,439
locked you in the storage room.

33
00:04:17,439 --> 00:04:18,439
Are you okay?

34
00:04:18,519 --> 00:04:19,399
Accidentally?

35
00:04:19,399 --> 00:04:21,120
Don't think I don't know what you're up to.

36
00:04:21,199 --> 00:04:22,120
Wait until we get home.

37
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:23,279
I'll make you pay.

38
00:04:23,759 --> 00:04:24,560
Sang Luo,

39
00:04:25,439 --> 00:04:26,439
come here for a second.

40
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:27,439
Lin Wanmei!

41
00:04:27,800 --> 00:04:28,920
What's it to you?

42
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:29,680
We're still on the clock.

43
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:30,839
She's my employee.

44
00:04:32,360 --> 00:04:33,360
What's your problem?

45
00:04:33,360 --> 00:04:34,279
Director Cheng.

46
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:36,120
Within the Group,

47
00:04:36,120 --> 00:04:38,279
you need to address me as Vice President.

48
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:40,439
Sang Luo,

49
00:04:40,439 --> 00:04:40,959
grab your bag.

50
00:04:40,959 --> 00:04:41,680
Come with me.

51
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:44,240
Okay,

52
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:45,120
Vice President.

53
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:46,800
Bitch.

54
00:04:46,839 --> 00:04:47,720
What are you looking at?

55
00:04:47,759 --> 00:04:48,680
Don't you have work to do?

56
00:04:56,399 --> 00:04:57,920
So, were you trying to help me?

57
00:05:00,879 --> 00:05:01,680
I guess so.

58
00:05:02,120 --> 00:05:04,439
After all, we're partners now.

59
00:05:05,759 --> 00:05:06,560
However,

60
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:07,839
your methods against Cheng Ruolin

61
00:05:07,839 --> 00:05:09,040
aren't exactly brilliant.

62
00:05:09,519 --> 00:05:10,639
Relying on such petty tricks

63
00:05:10,639 --> 00:05:11,879
to take down Cheng Ruolin

64
00:05:12,680 --> 00:05:13,720
won't be easy.

65
00:05:15,040 --> 00:05:16,439
My rule is,

66
00:05:16,600 --> 00:05:17,680
an eye for an eye,

67
00:05:17,680 --> 00:05:18,879
a tooth for a tooth.

68
00:05:18,959 --> 00:05:19,759
Of course,

69
00:05:20,560 --> 00:05:21,839
to deal with Cheng Ruolin,

70
00:05:21,959 --> 00:05:23,439
I have other methods.

71
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:25,920
Otherwise, how could I partner with you?

72
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:29,000
Then I'm really looking forward to

73
00:05:29,519 --> 00:05:31,240
what other surprises you have for me.

74
00:05:32,759 --> 00:05:34,279
You'll get the chance to see them.

75
00:05:39,439 --> 00:05:40,439
Wait here for a second.

76
00:05:40,519 --> 00:05:41,480
I'm going to grab something.

77
00:05:56,439 --> 00:05:56,759
No.

78
00:05:57,560 --> 00:05:58,079
No, no.

79
00:05:58,480 --> 00:05:59,240
If you're gonna hit me, hit me.

80
00:05:59,240 --> 00:05:59,560
You... you...

81
00:05:59,560 --> 00:06:00,519
Don't use a weapon!

82
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:15,079
Look at these photos of you partying.

83
00:06:17,240 --> 00:06:18,439
This... This...

84
00:06:18,759 --> 00:06:20,399
Who took these?

85
00:06:20,560 --> 00:06:22,519
If I hadn't spent a fortune buying them,

86
00:06:23,240 --> 00:06:24,879
you'd be the top trending topic today.

87
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:27,040
If Mom were to see these scandals,

88
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:29,720
how do you think she'd deal with you?

89
00:06:32,839 --> 00:06:34,519
I'm warning you one last time.

90
00:06:34,519 --> 00:06:35,480
At Gufeng Group,

91
00:06:36,160 --> 00:06:37,319
your pride means nothing.

92
00:06:45,319 --> 00:06:45,959
Here.

93
00:06:46,040 --> 00:06:46,879
This is for you.

94
00:06:47,319 --> 00:06:48,279
See if you like it.

95
00:06:50,399 --> 00:06:51,199
For me?

96
00:06:55,560 --> 00:06:58,120
I never mistreat like-minded friends.

97
00:07:03,519 --> 00:07:05,079
Welcome to my team.

98
00:07:05,680 --> 00:07:07,680
I won't mistreat like-minded friends.

99
00:07:09,839 --> 00:07:10,800
Thank you, boss.

100
00:07:10,839 --> 00:07:12,439
I'll definitely work hard.

101
00:07:19,040 --> 00:07:19,839
You don't like it?

102
00:07:21,279 --> 00:07:22,079
No.

103
00:07:22,319 --> 00:07:23,680
I really like the gift.

104
00:07:26,800 --> 00:07:29,199
But Auntie Lin's words touch me more.

105
00:07:30,360 --> 00:07:31,399
Here's to our partnership.

106
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:33,439
To like-minded friends.

107
00:07:36,079 --> 00:07:37,000
Here's to our partnership.

108
00:07:41,079 --> 00:07:42,439
Let's get you some pampering.

109
00:07:42,639 --> 00:07:43,600
Thank you, Auntie Lin.

110
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:44,319
Welcome.

111
00:07:44,319 --> 00:07:46,240
It's really rare to see Wanmei bring a friend.

112
00:07:46,240 --> 00:07:47,480
Our shop happens

113
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:48,959
to have launched a new eye treatment today.

114
00:07:49,040 --> 00:07:49,720
After the treatment,

115
00:07:49,720 --> 00:07:50,560
your eyes will be sparkling.

116
00:07:50,639 --> 00:07:52,160
I'll arrange it for both of you right away.

117
00:07:55,800 --> 00:07:57,959
Do you have treatments for men here too?

118
00:08:03,160 --> 00:08:04,920
He's the winemaker for our shop.

119
00:08:05,519 --> 00:08:06,240
Wanmei,

120
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:06,959
this way, please.

121
00:08:14,199 --> 00:08:14,959
Please.

122
00:08:17,120 --> 00:08:18,279
It's because our shop is too small

123
00:08:18,279 --> 00:08:20,720
that we can't afford a top winemaker like Wanmei.

124
00:08:20,800 --> 00:08:22,399
I hope we get a chance to collaborate.

125
00:08:22,959 --> 00:08:24,040
There will be opportunities.

126
00:08:26,480 --> 00:08:27,319
Xiaxia,

127
00:08:27,439 --> 00:08:28,800
take Miss Sang to get ready first.

128
00:08:28,800 --> 00:08:29,920
I need to use the restroom.

129
00:08:29,920 --> 00:08:30,680
Okay.

130
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:31,439
Miss Sang,

131
00:08:31,439 --> 00:08:32,200
this way, please.

132
00:08:46,799 --> 00:08:48,200
Cheng Feng is finally dead.

133
00:08:48,360 --> 00:08:49,200
Now,

134
00:08:49,679 --> 00:08:51,000
I belong only to you.

135
00:08:51,759 --> 00:08:52,559
Yucheng,

136
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:54,639
I want a baby.

137
00:08:54,879 --> 00:08:56,440
A baby of our own.

138
00:08:57,159 --> 00:08:58,679
But I can't let our baby

139
00:08:58,679 --> 00:08:59,919
be born into danger.

140
00:09:00,440 --> 00:09:01,919
For our future together,

141
00:09:02,519 --> 00:09:04,159
you and I both need to compromise.

142
00:09:07,960 --> 00:09:09,559
I can never say no to you.

143
00:09:22,759 --> 00:09:23,559
Lin Wanmei!

144
00:09:23,919 --> 00:09:25,360
Get the hell out here!

145
00:09:26,279 --> 00:09:27,080
Lin Wanmei!

146
00:09:27,679 --> 00:09:28,480
Where is she?

147
00:09:30,240 --> 00:09:31,039
Get out here!

148
00:09:33,360 --> 00:09:34,159
Auntie Hong.

149
00:09:35,360 --> 00:09:37,360
Where's Lin Wanmei and that little bitch Sang Luo?

150
00:09:37,639 --> 00:09:39,840
Madam and Miss Sang Luo haven't returned yet.

151
00:09:41,039 --> 00:09:42,200
Partners in crime.

152
00:09:42,480 --> 00:09:44,799
Who knows where they're fooling around with wild men.

153
00:09:44,840 --> 00:09:45,759
Pour me a glass of wine.

154
00:09:48,759 --> 00:09:49,840
I said, pour me a glass of wine.

155
00:09:49,840 --> 00:09:50,960
Didn't you hear me?

156
00:09:52,679 --> 00:09:53,120
I...

157
00:09:53,159 --> 00:09:54,879
I'll go to the cellar and get you some wine in a minute.

158
00:09:55,320 --> 00:09:56,159
This bottle of wine...

159
00:09:56,159 --> 00:09:57,799
Madam specifically requested it.

160
00:10:00,320 --> 00:10:01,200
Lin Wanmei?

161
00:10:02,960 --> 00:10:04,919
Madam hasn't been sleeping well lately.

162
00:10:05,440 --> 00:10:07,720
She drinks this red wine every night to help her sleep.

163
00:10:07,840 --> 00:10:08,639
I need to

164
00:10:08,639 --> 00:10:10,519
let it breathe for her in advance.

165
00:10:11,240 --> 00:10:13,200
Lin Wanmei is pregnant.

166
00:10:14,279 --> 00:10:16,000
How can she drink wine?

167
00:10:16,279 --> 00:10:17,080
Auntie Hong.

168
00:10:19,039 --> 00:10:21,200
Besides drinking red wine,

169
00:10:21,559 --> 00:10:22,720
has Lin Wanmei been acting unusual in any other way?

170
00:10:23,759 --> 00:10:24,559
Well...

171
00:10:28,559 --> 00:10:29,360
Lin Wanmei!

172
00:10:29,960 --> 00:10:30,919
What is this?

173
00:10:31,159 --> 00:10:32,600
You're not pregnant at all!

174
00:10:37,720 --> 00:10:38,279
Mom,

175
00:10:38,279 --> 00:10:39,240
let me explain.

176
00:10:39,639 --> 00:10:40,960
Sister-in-law,

177
00:10:41,039 --> 00:10:43,720
how dare you lie about something like this?

178
00:10:44,279 --> 00:10:45,600
Artificial insemination?

179
00:10:45,960 --> 00:10:47,600
My brother is already dead.

180
00:10:47,639 --> 00:10:49,440
Whose child are you carrying?

181
00:10:49,679 --> 00:10:50,480
Mom,

182
00:10:51,159 --> 00:10:52,159
when Feng was alive,

183
00:10:52,159 --> 00:10:54,320
we did discuss artificial insemination.

184
00:10:54,360 --> 00:10:55,360
It was just so you could

185
00:10:55,360 --> 00:10:56,799
have a grandson sooner!

186
00:10:56,799 --> 00:10:57,559
Sister-in-law,

187
00:10:58,200 --> 00:11:00,000
you're still denying it even now?

188
00:11:00,320 --> 00:11:02,960
You're not carrying the Cheng family's seed at all.

189
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:03,799
Mom,

190
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:05,159
don't let her fool you.

191
00:11:06,080 --> 00:11:06,879
Dr. Li,

192
00:11:08,200 --> 00:11:09,360
examine her.

193
00:11:10,799 --> 00:11:13,720
I want to see if there's any truth coming out of her mouth.

194
00:11:13,960 --> 00:11:14,480
Yes,

195
00:11:14,480 --> 00:11:15,279
Old Madam.

196
00:11:25,679 --> 00:11:26,279
Madam.

197
00:11:26,279 --> 00:11:26,919
Please.

198
00:11:52,679 --> 00:11:53,480
Dr. Li.

199
00:11:53,720 --> 00:11:54,720
What are the results?

200
00:11:55,440 --> 00:11:56,600
Madam is indeed

201
00:12:00,200 --> 00:12:01,279
Madam is indeed

202
00:12:01,320 --> 00:12:02,200
pregnant.

203
00:12:02,200 --> 00:12:04,200
However, the fetus isn't very stable at this early stage.

204
00:12:04,200 --> 00:12:05,360
She needs plenty of rest

205
00:12:05,360 --> 00:12:06,240
to prevent any accidents.

206
00:12:06,240 --> 00:12:06,960
What?

207
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:08,279
Did you make a mistake?

208
00:12:08,519 --> 00:12:10,080
How could Lin Wanmei be pregnant?

209
00:12:10,080 --> 00:12:11,399
Cheng Ruolin, that's enough!

210
00:12:12,519 --> 00:12:14,919
I don't think I've ever wronged you.

211
00:12:15,279 --> 00:12:16,960
Why do you always target me?

212
00:12:17,840 --> 00:12:18,639
Mom.

213
00:12:19,039 --> 00:12:20,559
You may not believe me,

214
00:12:20,720 --> 00:12:22,000
but you can't just let Ruolin

215
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:24,320
bully me and Feng's child like this.

216
00:12:24,480 --> 00:12:25,120
Lin Wanmei!

217
00:12:25,120 --> 00:12:26,000
You bitch!

218
00:12:26,039 --> 00:12:26,799
Shut up!

219
00:12:29,559 --> 00:12:32,000
Your usual petty squabbles are one thing,

220
00:12:32,399 --> 00:12:35,159
but this involves your brother's child.

221
00:12:35,279 --> 00:12:37,200
Lin Wanmei is your sister-in-law.

222
00:12:37,240 --> 00:12:38,480
You need to respect her.

223
00:12:38,919 --> 00:12:39,720
Mom!

224
00:12:43,559 --> 00:12:44,480
Wanmei.

225
00:12:44,720 --> 00:12:46,120
You've been wronged this time.

226
00:12:46,519 --> 00:12:48,799
Since the doctor said you need to rest,

227
00:12:49,279 --> 00:12:50,639
as for your company affairs,

228
00:12:50,639 --> 00:12:52,120
don't worry about them for now.

229
00:12:52,440 --> 00:12:54,279
Just focus on resting at home.

230
00:12:54,879 --> 00:12:55,679
Mom.

231
00:12:56,679 --> 00:12:59,279
Gufeng Group is about to enter the next red wine competition.

232
00:13:00,240 --> 00:13:01,519
Feng just passed away.

233
00:13:01,639 --> 00:13:03,320
The market is already unstable.

234
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:05,200
If I step away now,

235
00:13:06,120 --> 00:13:07,600
what will happen to Feng's hard work?

236
00:13:08,639 --> 00:13:09,559
Don't worry.

237
00:13:09,799 --> 00:13:11,960
I'll definitely take good care of myself and the baby.

238
00:13:12,559 --> 00:13:13,360
All right then.

239
00:13:13,600 --> 00:13:14,360
Remember,

240
00:13:14,360 --> 00:13:15,559
take care of your health.

241
00:13:16,120 --> 00:13:17,279
I'll also send people

242
00:13:18,039 --> 00:13:19,360
to do their best to assist you.

243
00:13:20,600 --> 00:13:21,399
Thank you, Mom.

244
00:13:31,200 --> 00:13:33,120
You put so much effort into setting up this trap.

245
00:13:34,039 --> 00:13:34,919
What a pity.

246
00:13:34,960 --> 00:13:36,080
It all went up in smoke.

247
00:13:38,320 --> 00:13:39,759
What are you saying, Uncle?

248
00:13:40,519 --> 00:13:41,320
I don't understand.

249
00:13:44,759 --> 00:13:45,960
Cheng Ruolin might be a fool,

250
00:13:46,159 --> 00:13:48,080
but that doesn't mean the whole Cheng family is stupid.

251
00:13:49,399 --> 00:13:50,679
You didn't even verify if she was pregnant

252
00:13:50,679 --> 00:13:52,080
before making your move.

253
00:13:54,759 --> 00:13:56,679
You're not as smart as I thought.

254
00:13:58,759 --> 00:14:00,759
Auntie Lin being pregnant is a good thing.

255
00:14:01,279 --> 00:14:02,360
Uncle, you must be looking forward to

256
00:14:02,360 --> 00:14:04,000
this unborn baby, right?

257
00:14:14,440 --> 00:14:15,240
Don't touch.

258
00:14:15,799 --> 00:14:16,679
What do you mean?

259
00:14:16,679 --> 00:14:17,600
Exactly what it sounds like.

260
00:14:23,039 --> 00:14:25,480
Who's this affectionate act for, Uncle?

261
00:14:25,879 --> 00:14:26,919
There's no audience.

262
00:14:28,159 --> 00:14:28,919
I'll touch it anyway.

263
00:14:29,039 --> 00:14:30,159
I'll touch it, so what?

264
00:14:32,399 --> 00:14:33,679
Who exactly are you?

265
00:14:53,960 --> 00:14:54,840
Remember to apply the ointment.

266
00:15:17,320 --> 00:15:18,200
Did you miss me?

267
00:15:19,159 --> 00:15:19,840
Yucheng.

268
00:15:21,240 --> 00:15:22,120
I'm pregnant.

269
00:15:22,519 --> 00:15:23,240
Really?

270
00:15:23,720 --> 00:15:24,320
Wanmei.

271
00:15:24,639 --> 00:15:25,519
We're having a baby!

272
00:15:26,159 --> 00:15:26,840
But...

273
00:15:28,440 --> 00:15:29,320
I'm so scared.

274
00:15:29,759 --> 00:15:32,559
You don't know what Cheng Ruolin did to me today.

275
00:15:32,919 --> 00:15:35,080
If anything happens to our baby...

276
00:15:36,440 --> 00:15:37,320
what should I do?

277
00:15:38,240 --> 00:15:39,120
Don't cry, Wanmei.

278
00:15:39,759 --> 00:15:43,679
I won't let anyone hurt you and the baby.

279
00:15:45,120 --> 00:15:45,879
Okay.

280
00:15:47,960 --> 00:15:49,720
About Cheng Ruolin's funding gap...

281
00:15:50,080 --> 00:15:51,320
We need to give her a push.

282
00:15:51,399 --> 00:15:52,840
And tell Manager Wei

283
00:15:53,360 --> 00:15:54,639
it's time for him to step in.

284
00:16:01,960 --> 00:16:02,840
But Sang Luo,

285
00:16:04,600 --> 00:16:06,440
I've noticed you've changed.

286
00:16:10,360 --> 00:16:12,320
Is that insider info you mentioned really reliable?

287
00:16:12,799 --> 00:16:13,639
Let me tell you,

