00:29:36,680 --> 00:29:38,039
May you grow younger every year.

576
00:29:38,319 --> 00:29:39,119
Thank you.

577
00:29:41,200 --> 00:29:41,920
Madam,

578
00:29:41,920 --> 00:29:42,680
happy birthday.

579
00:29:42,680 --> 00:29:43,640
Thank you, thank you.

580
00:29:45,119 --> 00:29:45,920
Over there...

581
00:29:46,319 --> 00:29:47,799
Time really flies.

582
00:29:49,400 --> 00:29:49,720
It does.

583
00:29:49,720 --> 00:29:50,519
Is that so?

584
00:29:51,519 --> 00:29:53,200
Where are you off to watch the drama?

585
00:29:53,200 --> 00:29:54,200
None of your business!

586
00:29:55,359 --> 00:29:56,960
The layout here is really nice!

587
00:29:57,400 --> 00:29:58,599
Out of my way!

588
00:29:58,680 --> 00:30:00,000
The scenery here is really nice.

589
00:30:01,720 --> 00:30:02,559
Especially that place...

590
00:30:08,000 --> 00:30:08,960
Help!

591
00:30:09,200 --> 00:30:10,200
Help!

592
00:30:11,039 --> 00:30:11,839
What's going on?

593
00:30:13,000 --> 00:30:13,960
What happened?

594
00:30:14,799 --> 00:30:15,599
Let's go check it out.

595
00:30:17,119 --> 00:30:17,920
Dongdong!

596
00:30:18,160 --> 00:30:18,960
Dongdong!

597
00:30:20,200 --> 00:30:21,160
Help him up first.

598
00:30:22,880 --> 00:30:23,880
What happened to him?

599
00:30:24,119 --> 00:30:24,920
Oh my god!

600
00:30:25,440 --> 00:30:26,799
His face is covered in blood!

601
00:30:29,160 --> 00:30:29,680
Get the car!

602
00:30:29,680 --> 00:30:30,200
Hurry!

603
00:30:30,279 --> 00:30:31,240
He fell from here!

604
00:30:31,319 --> 00:30:32,119
Yeah.

605
00:30:33,799 --> 00:30:34,200
What's wrong?

606
00:30:34,200 --> 00:30:34,920
Wait a minute.

607
00:30:35,200 --> 00:30:36,319
Did anyone call an ambulance?

608
00:30:36,759 --> 00:30:37,759
What's going on here?

609
00:30:37,759 --> 00:30:39,200
Could he have been abused?

610
00:30:39,200 --> 00:30:40,200
Abusing a disabled child?

611
00:30:40,200 --> 00:30:41,359
That's too cruel!

612
00:30:45,119 --> 00:30:45,920
Everyone.

613
00:30:47,480 --> 00:30:49,640
Today's banquet ends here.

614
00:30:50,079 --> 00:30:51,319
Please head back.

615
00:30:51,680 --> 00:30:52,200
Well...

616
00:30:53,440 --> 00:30:53,880
This...

617
00:30:54,319 --> 00:30:55,160
Let's go, let's go.

618
00:30:56,119 --> 00:30:56,480
Forget it.

619
00:30:56,480 --> 00:30:57,359
Let's just leave.

620
00:30:58,480 --> 00:30:59,000
Yeah.

621
00:30:59,000 --> 00:31:00,319
What a mess.

622
00:31:06,000 --> 00:31:07,440
The injuries on Dongdong...

623
00:31:07,440 --> 00:31:08,599
did you do that?

624
00:31:08,680 --> 00:31:09,799
I don't know.

625
00:31:10,119 --> 00:31:11,240
You don't know?

626
00:31:11,720 --> 00:31:13,000
Do you think I'm blind?

627
00:31:13,559 --> 00:31:15,920
He is your own flesh and blood!

628
00:31:15,920 --> 00:31:17,559
How could you be so vicious?

629
00:31:17,920 --> 00:31:18,680
Mom, Mom, Mom...

630
00:31:18,680 --> 00:31:19,640
Calm down, calm down.

631
00:31:19,640 --> 00:31:20,640
I'll scold her for you.

632
00:31:20,880 --> 00:31:22,000
Cheng Ruolin, Cheng Ruolin.

633
00:31:22,000 --> 00:31:23,440
You truly have a viper's heart!

634
00:31:23,519 --> 00:31:24,559
Those injuries on Dongdong...

635
00:31:25,000 --> 00:31:26,119
are old scars and new wounds.

636
00:31:26,119 --> 00:31:26,960
It's obvious that for all these years,

637
00:31:26,960 --> 00:31:28,200
you've been abusing him.

638
00:31:28,279 --> 00:31:29,400
The servants told me before

639
00:31:29,400 --> 00:31:30,759
that you kept calling him a cripple.

640
00:31:30,759 --> 00:31:31,839
You wished he was dead.

641
00:31:31,839 --> 00:31:32,640
I didn't believe it.

642
00:31:32,640 --> 00:31:33,480
Now I finally see

643
00:31:33,480 --> 00:31:34,759
just how heartless you are.

644
00:31:34,880 --> 00:31:35,599
No, it's not like that.

645
00:31:35,599 --> 00:31:35,920
Mom!

646
00:31:35,920 --> 00:31:36,680
Are you done scolding?

647
00:31:37,039 --> 00:31:37,559
Mom.

648
00:31:37,559 --> 00:31:38,400
It's not like that.

649
00:31:39,759 --> 00:31:40,839
Kneel down!

650
00:31:45,119 --> 00:31:45,920
Mom.

651
00:31:47,079 --> 00:31:50,000
Dongdong is my own flesh and blood too.

652
00:31:50,519 --> 00:31:52,920
How could I not care for him?

653
00:31:53,920 --> 00:31:56,359
But I just can't control myself.

654
00:31:57,400 --> 00:31:58,279
Whenever I see him,

655
00:31:58,279 --> 00:32:00,240
I think of that man from the Xie family.

656
00:32:02,079 --> 00:32:02,960
You bitch!

657
00:32:03,319 --> 00:32:06,359
I bought you from your mother with my money.

658
00:32:06,680 --> 00:32:07,640
Do you believe

659
00:32:07,680 --> 00:32:09,599
that I'll throw you back to the Cheng family,

660
00:32:09,599 --> 00:32:10,359
and make your mother

661
00:32:10,359 --> 00:32:12,480
give me back my money?

662
00:32:12,480 --> 00:32:13,559
If that happens,

663
00:32:13,599 --> 00:32:14,799
your entire family

664
00:32:14,799 --> 00:32:17,480
will have to live on the streets across the way.

665
00:32:20,799 --> 00:32:21,920
I was wrong.

666
00:32:21,920 --> 00:32:24,720
You are just a bitch of the Xie family!

667
00:32:24,720 --> 00:32:26,240
A worthless bitch!

668
00:32:28,799 --> 00:32:30,000
Please forgive me!

669
00:32:30,000 --> 00:32:31,079
I was wrong.

670
00:32:31,079 --> 00:32:31,720
Mom.

671
00:32:32,759 --> 00:32:34,400
Please forgive me.

672
00:32:35,920 --> 00:32:36,720
Mom!

673
00:32:37,920 --> 00:32:38,960
There's something

674
00:32:38,960 --> 00:32:40,359
I need to tell you.

675
00:32:40,880 --> 00:32:42,200
These are the company's deficit accounts,

676
00:32:42,200 --> 00:32:43,440
and the employees' confessions.

677
00:32:45,599 --> 00:32:46,400
They said

678
00:32:47,079 --> 00:32:48,839
they were all ordered by President Ruolin.

679
00:32:53,519 --> 00:32:54,759
Did you do this?

680
00:32:56,160 --> 00:32:57,519
Have I mistreated you?

681
00:32:57,759 --> 00:32:59,640
Why would you do such a thing?

682
00:33:01,039 --> 00:33:01,839
Mom, Mom, Mom...

683
00:33:02,119 --> 00:33:03,079
Calm down, calm down.

684
00:33:09,920 --> 00:33:10,599
Mom.

685
00:33:10,599 --> 00:33:11,519
This is bad, this is bad!

686
00:33:11,720 --> 00:33:13,039
Our substandard syrup

687
00:33:13,400 --> 00:33:14,759
has been exposed!

688
00:33:21,119 --> 00:33:23,440
If I can bring this price down,

689
00:33:25,119 --> 00:33:26,759
wouldn't that cover the deficit?

690
00:33:28,200 --> 00:33:29,799
You did this again.

691
00:33:31,559 --> 00:33:33,000
I've always turned a

692
00:33:33,000 --> 00:33:35,240
blind eye to you.

693
00:33:35,599 --> 00:33:36,599
Why?

694
00:33:36,759 --> 00:33:39,720
Because you're my only daughter.

695
00:33:41,119 --> 00:33:42,599
Do you have any idea how much damage

696
00:33:42,599 --> 00:33:45,599
this news will cause the company?

697
00:33:46,319 --> 00:33:46,799
Mom.

698
00:33:47,000 --> 00:33:47,960
I'm sorry.

699
00:33:47,960 --> 00:33:48,599
Mom.

700
00:33:49,880 --> 00:33:51,119
Medicine. Medicine.

701
00:33:52,640 --> 00:33:53,279
Here, Mom.

702
00:33:53,279 --> 00:33:53,839
Calm down.

703
00:33:53,839 --> 00:33:55,440
Forgive me this once, please?

704
00:33:55,799 --> 00:33:57,759
For Dongdong's sake,

705
00:33:58,359 --> 00:33:59,559
You dare bring up Dongdong?

706
00:33:59,559 --> 00:34:00,359
You dare bring him up?

707
00:34:00,359 --> 00:34:02,000
Dongdong is lying in bed right now!

708
00:34:03,680 --> 00:34:04,279
Mom.

709
00:34:04,680 --> 00:34:05,200
Mom.

710
00:34:12,480 --> 00:34:13,079
Hello?

711
00:34:13,079 --> 00:34:15,079
You're infuriating me!

712
00:34:15,079 --> 00:34:16,199
You...

713
00:34:16,559 --> 00:34:17,599
I'm so fucking done with you.

714
00:34:17,599 --> 00:34:19,199
Consider that for the sake of the Cheng family,

715
00:34:19,320 --> 00:34:22,119
I married that old man from the Xie family.

716
00:34:22,760 --> 00:34:25,239
Can you please forgive me one last time?

717
00:34:25,719 --> 00:34:26,440
Mom.

718
00:34:27,000 --> 00:34:27,639
Mom. Fine.

719
00:34:28,360 --> 00:34:29,199
I got it.

720
00:34:33,960 --> 00:34:34,760
Mom.

721
00:34:35,679 --> 00:34:37,039
The shareholders are causing a scene,

722
00:34:37,480 --> 00:34:38,639
demanding an explanation.

723
00:34:47,360 --> 00:34:48,360
Tell them

724
00:34:51,360 --> 00:34:53,760
to strip Cheng Ruolin of her company duties

725
00:34:55,559 --> 00:34:57,239
and all her authority,

726
00:34:58,599 --> 00:34:59,800
but she will retain

727
00:35:00,599 --> 00:35:03,519
her shares and dividend rights.

728
00:35:19,000 --> 00:35:20,559
I have nothing left.

729
00:35:22,119 --> 00:35:22,920
Mom!

730
00:35:23,079 --> 00:35:25,599
I made so many sacrifices for the Cheng family.

731
00:35:26,320 --> 00:35:29,039
And now you won't even leave Gufeng Group to me!

732
00:35:29,559 --> 00:35:31,239
By taking Gufeng Group away from me,

733
00:35:31,239 --> 00:35:32,599
you're forcing me to die!

734
00:35:32,679 --> 00:35:33,159
No.

735
00:35:33,360 --> 00:35:34,400
Cheng... Cheng Ruolin!

736
00:35:34,760 --> 00:35:36,320
P-Put the knife down first!

737
00:35:36,320 --> 00:35:37,760
Are you threatening Mom?

738
00:35:37,880 --> 00:35:38,760
You shut up!

739
00:35:39,400 --> 00:35:41,599
I gave my whole life to the Cheng family!

740
00:35:42,199 --> 00:35:43,920
Aside from using the Cheng family's money to keep women,

741
00:35:43,920 --> 00:35:45,119
what have you ever done?

742
00:35:48,000 --> 00:35:48,920
And you,

743
00:35:49,119 --> 00:35:49,920
Lin Wanmei!

744
00:35:49,960 --> 00:35:51,119
You're an outsider!

745
00:35:51,599 --> 00:35:54,199
Why is your position at Gufeng Group higher than mine?

746
00:35:56,760 --> 00:35:57,559
Auntie,

747
00:35:58,079 --> 00:35:59,320
calm down.

748
00:35:59,760 --> 00:36:00,760
Auntie Lin

749
00:36:00,760 --> 00:36:02,239
is obviously more capable.

750
00:36:02,599 --> 00:36:03,960
The capable do more work.

751
00:36:04,079 --> 00:36:04,880
Capable?

752
00:36:05,760 --> 00:36:07,199
What capability does she have?

753
00:36:07,880 --> 00:36:10,239
She's just more ruthless than I am!

754
00:36:10,880 --> 00:36:11,760
Lin Wanmei!

755
00:36:12,199 --> 00:36:13,920
Do you remember Ye Xiaowei?

756
00:36:13,920 --> 00:36:15,239
Cheng Ruolin, shut up!

757
00:36:15,280 --> 00:36:16,440
What does Ye Xiaowei have to do with this?

758
00:36:16,679 --> 00:36:17,360
Right,

759
00:36:17,360 --> 00:36:18,199
and you!

760
00:36:18,880 --> 00:36:21,199
You bastard, what right do you have to stay in the Cheng family?

761
00:36:22,199 --> 00:36:23,400
You and Sang Luo,

762
00:36:23,480 --> 00:36:24,960
you're both bastards!

763
00:36:25,119 --> 00:36:26,400
I'll kill you!

764
00:36:26,400 --> 00:36:27,159
Cheng An, watch out!

765
00:36:29,320 --> 00:36:30,760
Cheng Ruolin, are you crazy?!

766
00:36:36,960 --> 00:36:38,000
My stomach!

767
00:36:39,920 --> 00:36:41,039
My baby!

768
00:36:43,639 --> 00:36:44,360
It's... It's okay, Mom.

769
00:36:44,400 --> 00:36:45,199
It's okay, Mom!

770
00:36:45,840 --> 00:36:46,679
Auntie Lin!

771
00:36:47,519 --> 00:36:48,639
My baby!

772
00:36:49,519 --> 00:36:50,519
My baby!

773
00:36:51,000 --> 00:36:51,800
Bastards

774
00:36:52,119 --> 00:36:53,320
just have cheap lives!

775
00:36:53,480 --> 00:36:54,400
Lunatic!

776
00:36:55,199 --> 00:36:56,159
Lunatic!

777
00:36:57,320 --> 00:36:58,599
Crazy.

778
00:36:58,800 --> 00:37:01,039
You're completely crazy!

779
00:37:04,119 --> 00:37:04,920
Cheng An!

780
00:37:05,599 --> 00:37:07,199
Send her to the Sanatorium.

781
00:37:07,760 --> 00:37:08,840
Lock her up!

782
00:37:09,320 --> 00:37:10,320
H-Hurry and take her away!

783
00:37:10,320 --> 00:37:11,239
Sanatorium?

784
00:37:11,519 --> 00:37:14,599
I made such a huge sacrifice for the Cheng family!

785
00:37:15,400 --> 00:37:18,559
I was a beautiful young girl once, too!

786
00:37:18,719 --> 00:37:19,519
Mom!

787
00:37:20,599 --> 00:37:22,880
The Xie family ruined my life.

788
00:37:23,880 --> 00:37:25,760
The Cheng family ruined my life!

789
00:37:26,199 --> 00:37:27,400
But ultimately,

790
00:37:27,400 --> 00:37:29,440
you ruined my life!

791
00:37:31,760 --> 00:37:33,000
Mom, Mom, Mom!

792
00:37:33,320 --> 00:37:34,639
Breathe, just breathe, Mom!

793
00:37:39,079 --> 00:37:39,960
Mom! Mom!

794
00:37:40,039 --> 00:37:40,840
Just breathe!

795
00:37:53,519 --> 00:37:55,679
Mom, Mom, Mom!

796
00:37:58,039 --> 00:37:58,400
Mom!

797
00:37:58,400 --> 00:37:59,079
It's okay.

798
00:37:59,079 --> 00:37:59,880
Mom!

799
00:38:02,199 --> 00:38:02,800
Here, here, here!

800
00:38:02,800 --> 00:38:03,800
Hurry, hurry, hurry!

801
00:38:04,039 --> 00:38:05,079
Move, move, move! Come on!

802
00:38:06,840 --> 00:38:07,639
Okay, okay, okay.

803
00:38:07,639 --> 00:38:08,480
Go, go, go!

804
00:38:08,800 --> 00:38:09,280
Mom!

805
00:38:09,280 --> 00:38:09,800
It's okay.

806
00:38:09,800 --> 00:38:10,320
It's okay, it's okay.

807
00:38:10,320 --> 00:38:11,079
Hang in there.

808
00:38:11,320 --> 00:38:12,119
It's okay, Mom.

809
00:38:12,199 --> 00:38:12,880
I'm here.

810
00:38:12,880 --> 00:38:13,840
I'm right here, I'm right here.

811
00:38:14,079 --> 00:38:14,880
It's okay.

812
00:38:24,000 --> 00:38:26,000
In a way, you're pitiful too.

813
00:38:27,119 --> 00:38:29,360
After all, it's the Cheng family that wronged you.

814
00:38:32,000 --> 00:38:34,000
But no matter how pitiful you are,

815
00:38:34,760 --> 00:38:37,599
you shouldn't have hurt innocent people like us.

816
00:38:40,119 --> 00:38:41,320
But don't worry.

817
00:38:42,480 --> 00:38:44,519
As for those treacherous people in the Cheng family,

818
00:38:45,280 --> 00:38:47,360
I won't spare a single one of them.
